I walk over to Nina's door.
I knock on the door.
Nina opens and smiles.
I show her the chocolate cake.
"Hi Nina," I say.
"I have a cake from the bakery."
"Hi Maya, how lovely!" Nina says.
We go into her living room.
The living room is very warm and cozy.
We sit on the soft sofa.
Nina makes hot tea for us.
We drink tea and eat the sweet cake.
The chocolate cake tastes really good.
We talk about our day in the city.
Nina asks about my new job.
I talk about the office and my colleague Peter.
Nina also talks about her day.
We laugh and talk all evening.
It is a really good evening.
I feel at home here in my new city.
